  "lore": "Spider-Man, also known as Peter Parker, is one of Marvel's most iconic superheroes. After being bitten by a radioactive spider, he gained enhanced strength, agility, spider-sense, and wall-crawling abilities, using his powers to protect New York as the friendly neighborhood Spider-Man."
